title: "EU AI Act Toolkit"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20277010
abstract: >
  A comprehensive, open-source toolkit providing practical templates, checklists,
  and governance documentation for organisations working toward EU AI Act readiness.
  Covers High-Risk AI systems, GPAI models, sector-specific packs (Healthcare, Finance,
  HR, Marketing), vendor due diligence, and compliance roadmaps. Designed for SMEs,
  legal professionals, and compliance teams — not a substitute for legal advice.
